OL,3,GNEWSAP&R's two-pronged budget approach
OL,4,Aunder fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoliticians have expressed dismay at
OL,7,FPolicy and Resources' (P&R) budget for
OL,8,F2027, stating it does not do enough to
OL,9,Fsupport ordinary islanders.
OL,11,FDeputy Adrian Gabriel said "I'm
OL,12,Fdisappointed" as he hit out at plans to
OL,13,Freduce tax caps and said he "would have
OL,14,Fliked to have seen their maximum
OL,15,Fliability, their cap, increase much
OL,16,Fmore".
OL,18,FDeputy Haley Camp said P&R's approach
OL,19,Fof presenting two budgets showed it had
OL,20,Fabandoned all spending discipline.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
