OL,3,GNEWSAP&R's two-pronged budget approach
OL,4,Aunder fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FP&R Treasury Lead Charles Parkinson
OL,7,Fsaid he never believed the direction to
OL,8,Freduce spending by 1% in real terms -
OL,9,Fwhich deputies agreed to last year -
OL,10,Fwas possible.
